Major Version 3.0.0 Update!
The app is  completely rewritten from the ground up using flutter and dart.
What's new:
• Modern, beautiful UI that supports both Dark Mode and Light Mode.
• Pinch-to-zoom support added to all ritual pages so you can adjust text size comfortably.
• Upgraded fonts: You can now toggle between the classic 'Ganapati' font and the modern 'Noto Sans Kannada' font for perfect Unicode rendering of Vedic symbols.
• Brand new, crisp, high-resolution Material Design icons and artwork.
• Deeply integrated localization engine for future multi-language support (Sanskrit & Telugu coming soon).
• Few bug fixes and text corrections in the Madhyahnika Sandhya & Arghya Sankalpa sections.
